  "body": "7 Tawa Place, Orewa\r\n\r\n5 Bed | 3 Bath | 3 Living | 2 Garage | 4 Off-Street Parks\r\n\r\nSpace, lifestyle and an outstanding Orewa location - this substantial family home delivers it all.\r\n\r\nSet on 567m² with approximately 275m² of floor area, the home offers five double bedrooms, three bathrooms and multiple living spaces designed for growing families.\r\n\r\nAt the heart of the home is a spacious gourmet kitchen with large island and separate scullery, flowing through the open-plan living and dining to expansive outdoor entertaining.\r\n\r\nWide sliders open onto the sunny deck, louvre-covered entertaining area and fully fenced lawn - perfect for BBQs, kids, pets and entertaining family and friends.\r\n\r\nA downstairs bedroom with ensuite is ideal for guests or extended family, while the impressive master suite creates a true parents' retreat with its own living/study space, walk-in wardrobe, ensuite and beautiful Orewa and estuary views.\r\n\r\nWalk to Orewa Primary School and enjoy easy access to Orewa Beach, cafés, restaurants, coastal walks and the motorway.\r\n\r\nOWNERS MOVING OVERSEAS - THIS HOME MUST SELL!\r\n\r\nAUCTION - 24 SEPTEMBER 2026 ( unless Sold Prior)\r\n\r\nCome for the location. Stay for the Orewa lifestyle.\r\n\r\nContact Team Steenberg today to arrange your viewing.\r\n\r\nNo Stress. Just Success.",
